Now it is the month of March.
It is very hot in Kochi now.
I am walking to my software office.
The morning sun is very hot.
Today I am wearing thick clothes.
These clothes are a big difficulty for me.
Thick clothes are not good in the hot season.
I need cotton clothes.
Cotton clothes are good.
I will go to a textile shop after work.
There is a big textile shop on MG Road.
That is a good shop.
I will buy lightweight cotton clothes from there.
Wearing cotton clothes in the office is good.
Tomorrow I will wear a new cotton garment.
